{
  "_about": "Roster of scheduled Claude agents for Yotam's business. `status` is proposed until Yotam approves the cadence; only then is a scheduled task created (scripts/agents.mjs prints the exact payload). Every agent is draft-only: it never posts, sends, spends or changes prices. Trigger kinds: cron (time) or event (poke-only task, fired by a person, a session, or a webhook caller; see docs/11-agents.md). `heartbeat_hours` (cron agents): if no run is recorded in scripts/agent-metrics.mjs within this many hours after the previous one, the report flags the agent SILENT. Set to cadence plus slack (intake skips Fri/Sat). Consolidated to 5 agents on 2026-11-26 (Yotam's decision): marketing, projects-scout, product-customers, sales, auditor.",
